00:18:12,069 --> 00:18:14,069
Go, Harusamban!

278
00:18:16,069 --> 00:18:18,069
It's the Sea Urchin Spike Unit!

279
00:18:18,069 --> 00:18:20,069
And their leader Harusamban!

280
00:18:22,069 --> 00:18:25,069
Before you do anything else, take out the kicking guy!

281
00:18:26,069 --> 00:18:29,069
Harusamban!

282
00:18:30,069 --> 00:18:32,069
Well, what are you gonna do now, huh?

283
00:18:33,069 --> 00:18:35,069
Sanji! Do be careful!

284
00:18:36,069 --> 00:18:38,069
How can you be so calm at a time like this?

285
00:18:38,069 --> 00:18:40,069
Hey!

286
00:18:48,069 --> 00:18:50,069
It's been a while since then.

287
00:18:50,069 --> 00:18:52,069
Sanji!

288
00:18:55,069 --> 00:18:57,069
I ran like hell.

289
00:18:57,069 --> 00:18:59,069
Come back, Candy Boy!

290
00:18:59,069 --> 00:19:01,069
Over my dead body!

291
00:19:02,069 --> 00:19:04,069
I brought my favorite dress just for you!

292
00:19:05,069 --> 00:19:07,069
Why don't you try it on?

293
00:19:07,069 --> 00:19:09,069
Don't be shy! It's just us!

294
00:19:09,069 --> 00:19:10,069
That's not the problem!

295
00:19:11,069 --> 00:19:12,069
Forget it!

296
00:19:14,069 --> 00:19:15,069
Through the rain...

297
00:19:16,069 --> 00:19:17,069
And the snow...

298
00:19:20,069 --> 00:19:21,069
Through thunder and lightning...

299
00:19:22,069 --> 00:19:23,069
I never stopped...

300
00:19:26,069 --> 00:19:27,069
Say your prayers!

301
00:19:28,069 --> 00:19:29,069
You stubborn bastard!

302
00:19:30,069 --> 00:19:31,069
Aren't you adorable?

303
00:19:32,069 --> 00:19:34,069
You can't just run away from us forever, you know!

304
00:19:34,069 --> 00:19:36,069
One of these days was certain to catch right up to you!

305
00:19:37,069 --> 00:19:38,069
Oh, Sanji!

306
00:19:39,069 --> 00:19:42,069
I've gotten myself out of tougher spots than this, haven't I?

307
00:19:43,069 --> 00:19:45,069
Sanji!

308
00:19:46,069 --> 00:19:48,069
Damn you!

309
00:19:49,069 --> 00:19:51,069
Can't win! Don't fight!

310
00:19:56,069 --> 00:20:00,069
Did I already forget everything that happened back at Sabahodi?

311
00:20:03,069 --> 00:20:04,069
Sanji!

312
00:20:05,069 --> 00:20:08,069
I need those recipes if I want to get stronger!

313
00:20:09,069 --> 00:20:10,069
And taking them down is the only way!

314
00:20:11,069 --> 00:20:12,069
Bring it on!

315
00:20:13,069 --> 00:20:14,069
Candy boy!

316
00:20:15,069 --> 00:20:17,069
There's no escape, Sanji!

317
00:20:20,069 --> 00:20:22,069
You're all mine!

318
00:20:23,069 --> 00:20:24,069
Goodness gracious!

319
00:20:24,069 --> 00:20:26,069
Now you're all surrounded, aren't you?

320
00:20:29,069 --> 00:20:30,069
Sanji!

321
00:20:31,069 --> 00:20:33,069
Sanji darling!

322
00:20:34,069 --> 00:20:36,069
Sweet my sugar bear!

323
00:20:37,069 --> 00:20:42,069
My courage had left me, and there was nowhere to run.

324
00:21:00,069 --> 00:21:01,069
Then...

325
00:21:01,069 --> 00:21:03,069
What the...

326
00:21:04,069 --> 00:21:05,069
He's gone!

327
00:21:05,069 --> 00:21:06,069
Huh?

328
00:21:13,069 --> 00:21:14,069
I found a new path.

329
00:21:15,069 --> 00:21:17,069
Don't you wait!

330
00:21:20,069 --> 00:21:21,069
And then...

331
00:21:22,069 --> 00:21:23,069
Before long...

332
00:21:26,069 --> 00:21:27,069
I was flying.

333
00:21:31,069 --> 00:21:32,069
You're flying!

334
00:21:32,069 --> 00:21:33,069
Huh?

335
00:21:34,069 --> 00:21:35,069
Haha!

336
00:21:36,069 --> 00:21:37,069
Skywalk!

337
00:21:38,069 --> 00:21:39,069
Awesome!

338
00:21:39,069 --> 00:21:40,069
Sanji can walk on air now!

339
00:21:41,069 --> 00:21:42,069
Like those other guys!

340
00:21:50,069 --> 00:21:51,069
Skywalk.

341
00:21:51,069 --> 00:21:52,069
Oh, I see.

342
00:21:53,069 --> 00:21:54,069
Not moonwalk.

343
00:21:55,069 --> 00:21:56,069
Hey scumbags!

344
00:21:57,069 --> 00:21:58,069
Whoa!

345
00:21:58,069 --> 00:21:59,069
He's flying!

346
00:21:59,069 --> 00:22:00,069
If you've got something to say to the princess,

347
00:22:00,069 --> 00:22:02,069
you'll have to go through me first!

348
00:22:03,069 --> 00:22:04,069
Uh...

349
00:22:04,069 --> 00:22:05,069
Cause I just happen to be her.

350
00:22:06,069 --> 00:22:07,069
Knight in shining armor!

351
00:22:08,069 --> 00:22:09,069
Thank you, Sanji!

352
00:22:09,069 --> 00:22:11,069
Are you some kind of wise guy?

353
00:22:14,069 --> 00:22:15,069
Let's cook these small fries!

354
00:22:16,069 --> 00:22:17,069
Diablo!

355
00:22:17,069 --> 00:22:18,069
The Jomber!

356
00:22:19,069 --> 00:22:20,069
The Wall of Fear!

357
00:22:20,069 --> 00:22:21,069
Spector!

358
00:22:22,069 --> 00:22:23,069
Spector!

359
00:22:41,069 --> 00:22:42,069
Hey Hordy!

360
00:22:46,069 --> 00:22:47,069
It's almost over.

361
00:22:47,069 --> 00:22:49,069
So you can just sit tight.

362
00:22:52,069 --> 00:22:55,069
You can send a hundred thousand or ten million guys after us!

363
00:22:56,069 --> 00:22:57,069
But every single one of them is going down!

364
00:22:58,069 --> 00:22:59,069
You hear me?

365
00:23:10,069 --> 00:23:12,069
Brooke and Robin tear through the battlefield with their new skills,

366
00:23:13,069 --> 00:23:17,069
forcing the new Fishman pirates to counter-attack with their deadly Venom squad.

367
00:23:17,069 --> 00:23:21,069
Not to be outdone, Frankie shows off a new weapon of monumental proportions.

368
00:23:22,069 --> 00:23:26,069
His crewmates are dazzled, but Hordy may have something even more impressive in store.

369
00:23:27,069 --> 00:23:28,069
On the next, One Piece!

370
00:23:29,069 --> 00:23:30,069
Unveiled!

371
00:23:30,069 --> 00:23:32,069
The Secret Weapons of the Sunny!

372
00:23:32,069 --> 00:23:34,069
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

